# Deploy (Render.com)

- **Production:** Render Web Service → https://webstudio-muenchen.com (also https://saas-mvp-funnel.onrender.com).
- **Service id (known):** `srv-da1dg061egvs73ai5ubg`
- **How to deploy:** `git push origin main` — Render auto-deploys from GitHub `main`. That is the normal path.
- Do **not** deploy SaaS to Railway / Netlify / Vercel. `railway.toml` is not the production path.
- Do **not** run `railway up` for «деплой».
- When user says «деплой» / «пуш»: commit relevant code (no secrets). Do **not** stage deletions of existing `data/manifests/*` or anything that would break a client link — see `never-delete-client-links.mdc`. Then `git push origin main`, then confirm site responds (`x-render-origin-server: Render`).
- Render CLI may be unauthenticated; git push is enough when auto-deploy is on.
